@startuml sequence-vlm-formulas
!include elvira.iuml
' =============================================================================
' What: a POST /v1/formulas batch is admitted only while the queue has room, then holds the model for its whole batch and answers per-item results; beyond the queue the caller gets 503 with Retry-After.
' Kind: UML sequence diagram. Scope: one request, from admission to response; model load and probes are notes.
' Source: src/evilflowers_vlm/app.py, engine.py, telemetry.py; issue evilflowers-vlm-service#1 (2026-11-16)
' =============================================================================

title POST /v1/formulas (proposal, 2026-11-16)

participant "caller\n(digitalizer, equation-service)" as caller
participant "app\nFastAPI :8000" as app <<focus>>
participant "ServiceState\nadmitted · lock" as state
participant "PaddleEngine" as engine

note over app, engine : At start-up the model loads in a background thread.\n/healthz = 200 at once (500 if the load failed); /readyz = 503 until the weights are in memory.

caller -[$accent_msg()]> app : <b>POST /v1/formulas</b> items[≤32] (traceparent)
activate app
note right of app : SERVER span "POST /v1/formulas"
alt model not loaded yet
  app -> state : vlm_queue_rejections_total{reason=loading}++
  app --> caller : 503 Retry-After: n "model is loading"
else admitted > VLM_MAX_QUEUE
  app -> state : vlm_queue_rejections_total{reason=busy}++
  app --> caller : 503 Retry-After: n "busy: queue full"
else admitted
  app -> state : admitted++, await lock
  note right of app : INTERNAL span "vlm.batch" (items)
  loop each item, one crop at a time
    app -> app : base64 → PNG (≤8 MB) → normalize
    app -> engine : recognize(crop, task)
    engine --> app : text | RuntimeError
    app -> state : vlm_items_total{task,outcome}++, vlm_item_seconds
  end
  app -> state : release lock, admitted--
  app --> caller : 200 {model, results[key, text|error, secs]}
end
deactivate app

caption A busy service never makes the caller time out: it either runs the batch or answers 503 with a Retry-After sized from the recent request time.
footer ELVIRA · FIIT STU · evilflowers-vlm-service · docs/diagrams/sequence-vlm-formulas.puml
@enduml
